        "number": 1,
        "instructionsHtml": "Part 1<p>Listen and answer questions 1–10.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "maxWords": 2,
            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-title\">Bankside Recruitment Agency</div>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>Address of agency: 497 Eastside, Docklands</li>\n<li>Name of agent: Becky {{1}}</li>\n<li>Phone number: 07866 510333</li>\n<li>Best to call her in the {{2}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Typical jobs</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>Clerical and admin roles, mainly in the finance industry</li>\n<li>Must have good {{3}} skills</li>\n<li>Jobs are usually for at least one {{4}}</li>\n<li>Pay is usually £{{5}} per hour</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Registration process</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>Wear a {{6}} to the interview</li>\n<li>Must bring your {{7}} to the interview</li>\n<li>They will ask questions about each applicant's {{8}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Advantages of using an agency</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\">\n<li>The {{9}} you receive at interview will benefit you</li>\n<li>Will get access to vacancies which are not advertised</li>\n<li>Less {{10}} is involved in applying for jobs</li>\n</ul></div>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "instructionsHtml": "Part 2<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 11–14</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p><p><strong>Matthews Island Holidays</strong></p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "According to the speaker, the company",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "has been in business for longer than most of its competitors."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "arranges holidays to more destinations than its competitors."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "has more customers than its competitors."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "Where can customers meet the tour manager before travelling to the Isle of Man?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "Liverpool"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "Heysham"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "Luton"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "How many lunches are included in the price of the holiday?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "three"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "four"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "five"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "Customers have to pay extra for",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "guaranteeing themselves a larger room."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "booking at short notice."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "transferring to another date."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 15–20</h3><p>Complete the table below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "maxWords": 2,
            "bodyHtml": "<table class=\"q-table\"><caption class=\"summary-title\">Timetable for Isle of Man holiday</caption>\n<thead><tr><th></th><th>Activity</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Day 1</td><td>Arrive</td><td>Introduction by manager<br>Hotel dining room has view of the {{15}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Day 2</td><td>Tynwald Exhibition and Peel</td><td>Tynwald may have been founded in {{16}} not 979.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Day 3</td><td>Trip to Snaefell</td><td>Travel along promenade in a tram; train to Laxey; train to the {{17}} of Snaefell</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Day 4</td><td>Free day</td><td>Company provides a {{18}} for local transport and heritage sites.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Day 5</td><td>Take the {{19}} railway train from Douglas to Port Erin</td><td>Free time, then coach to Castletown – former {{20}} has old castle.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Day 6</td><td>Leave</td><td>Leave the island by ferry or plane</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>"
          }
        ]
      },
